<title>FRANCE: CYCLING-PARIS-NICE FIRST STAGE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-PARIS-NICE FIRST STAGE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading placings in Sunday's opening stage of the Paris-Nice race, a 7.1 km time-trial from Neuilly-sur-Seine to Paris:</p>
<p> 1. Laurent Jalabert (France) Once 8 minutes 19 seconds</p>
<p> 2. Andrei Chmil (Ukraine) Lotto	 4 seconds behind</p>
<p> 3. Melchor Mauri (Spain) Once		  7</p>
<p> 4. Jacky Durand (France) Casino	     10</p>
<p> 5. Laurent Dufaux (Switzerland) Festina   same time</p>
<p> 6. Francois Moreau (France) Cofidis	 11</p>
<p> 7. Christophe Moreau (France) Festina     12</p>
<p> 8. Stepahne Meulot (France) Francaise des Jeux 13</p>
<p> 9. Yevgeniy Berzin (Russia) Batik		</p>
<p> 10. Armand de las Cuevas (France) Banesto both same time</p>
<p> 11. Adriano Baffi (Italy) US Postal	 15</p>
<p> 12. Viacheslav Ekimov (Russia) US Postal  16</p>
<p> 13. Angel Casero (Spain) Banesto	    same time</p>
<p> 14. Johan Museeuw (Belgium) Mapei	   17</p>
<p> 15. Tony Rominger (Switzerland) Cofidis   same time</p>
<p> 16. Pascal Lino (France) Big Mat	    18</p>
<p> 17. Pascal Chanteur (France) Casino	 same time</p>
<p> 18. Tom Steels (Belgium) Mapei		19</p>
<p> 19. Didier Rous (France) Festina	    same time</p>
<p> 20. Santiago Blanco (Spain) Banesto	 20</p>
